hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"892","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se do aadmiyon ke bare mein riwayat hai jinhon ne len den mein jhagda kiya, aur un donon ke paas koi daleel na thi. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon ko hukm diya: 'Woh qasam ke liye qura dalein, chahe pasand karen ya napasand.'"
"893","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab do aadmiyon ko (kuch) lene par majboor kiya jae to un ke darmiyan qura dalna pasandeeda amal hai.'"
"894","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab log raaste ke bare mein ikhtilaf karen to use saat hath muqarrar karo.'"
"895","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab log raaste ke bare mein ikhtilaf karen to use saat hath muqarrar karo.'"
"896","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bani Israil mein se ek aadmi ne doosre aadmi se zameen khareedi, aur us ne us mein sone ka mohar laga ghada paya. To us ne zameen bechne wale se kaha: Apna ghada le lo, kyunke main ne zameen khareedi hai, sona nahin khareeda. Doosre aadmi ne kaha: Kya tum mujhe woh maal wapas karna chahte ho jo Allah ne mujh se le liya hai? To donon muqadma qazi ke paas lae. Qazi ne kaha: Kya tum donon ki aulad hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Ek ne kaha: Mera beta hai, aur doosre ne kaha: Meri beti hai. Us ne kaha: Phir ek ka doosre se nikah kar do, aur yeh maal donon ko de do, taake woh use apne upar kharch karen aur us mein se sadaqa bhi den.'"
"897","[AI-translation] Shahr bin Haushab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek lashkar bheja. Woh ek dehati ke paas se guzre jo apni bakriyon mein tha. Unhon ne us se kaha: 'Hamare liye zibah karo.' To woh un ke paas ek bakri laya. Unhon ne kaha: 'Yeh dubli hai.' Woh doosri laya, aur unhon ne kaha: 'Yeh bhi dubli hai.' Phir unhon ne ek moti tazi bakri pakdi, use zibah kiya, aur use khaya. Jab din ki garmi shadeed hui aur us ki bakriyan us ke baade mein thin to unhon ne us se kaha: 'Apni bakriyan bahar lao taake ham is baade mein saya len.' Us ne kaha: 'Meri bakri ne abhi bachcha jana hai. Agar main use bahar launga to woh fauran garmi se mutassir hogi aur kharab ho jayegi.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Hamari jaanen hamen tumhari bakri se ziyada azeez hain.' To unhon ne use zabardasti bahar lane par majboor kiya, aur woh bahar gai. Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko bataya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne intezar farmaya yahan tak ke lashkar wapas aaya. Phir Aap ne un se poocha, aur woh Allah ki qasmen khane lage ke unhon ne aisa nahin kiya. Dehati ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Jo main ne Aap ko bataya hai wahi unhon ne kiya hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un mein se ek aadmi ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: 'Agar un mein koi khair hai to woh us mein hai.' Phir Aap ne us se poocha, aur us ne Aap ko bilkul waisa bataya jaisa dehati ne kaha tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum jhoot mein aise girte ho jaise patange aag mein girte hain. Har jhoot yaqeenan jhoot likha jata hai siwae teen ke: jang mein jhoot, kyunke jang fareb hai; do logon mein sulah karane ke liye jhoot; aur aadmi ka apni biwi ko khush karne ke liye jhoot bolna.'"
"898","[AI-translation] Shahr bin Haushab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek lashkar bheja — phir rawi ne pichli hadees ki manind (waqiya) zikr kiya, aur kaha: Rewad khaime mein tha, to unhon ne apne ghode us mein dauda diye."
"899","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke do aurten ghar mein joote/moaze seene ka kaam kar rahi thin, aur un donon ke siwa un ke sath koi nahin tha. Un mein se ek ne doosri ke hath par suja mara, aur woh us ke hath mein paar ho gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Doosri ne use suje se mara. Is ke bare mein Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko khat likha gaya, aur jab unhen bataya gaya to unhon ne kaha: Daleel aur saboot ke baghair koi faisla nahin hoga, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar logon ko mahaz un ke da'won par cheezen di jayen to log doosron ki jaanen aur amwal ka da'wa karenge. Lekin qasam mudda'alaih par hai.' Donon ko bulao aur unhen Quran padh kar sunao: 'Jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ko thodi qeemat ke badle bechte hain...' To jab yeh kaha gaya to us ne iqrar kar liya."
"900","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam aur ek gawah se faisla farmaya. Amr ne kaha: Yeh maal ke bare mein hai. Abu Muhammad (Ibn Dinar) ne kaha: Is bab mein is se ziyada sahih koi hadees nahin hai."
